erial/diverted-vs-residual/%/blank tonnage/empty=0-not-NaN), parseMonthKey, groupDiversionByMonth (multi-month ordering + labels + undated last), and buildLeedWorkbookModel (one sheet per month, header/columns/TOTAL row) — 9/9 pass.
